    "body": "Hi @DavidSSL, this issue is caused because some tests in the AWS will parse the `.aws/config` file to find the default region, and assume that it is going to be empty I assume on you machine that is not the case. I've opened a PR to fix this but we are having some issues with our CI at the moment so might be a little while before it gets released. A quick and dirty work around would be to `mv .aws .aws-backup`  install/update starship then `mv .aws-backup .aws` until we can get the fix merged and released.",
